 402:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_gpio.c ****   * @brief  Set or clear the selected data port bit.
 403:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_gpio.c ****   * @note   This function uses GPIOx_BSRR and GPIOx_BRR registers to allow atomic read/modify
 404:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_gpio.c ****   *         accesses. In this way, there is no risk of an IRQ occurring between
